2879|n|To play or move to and fro; to move one way and the other; hence, to totter; to reel; to swing; to flutter. ; To be unsettled in opinion; to vacillate; to be undetermined; to fluctuate; as, to water in judgment. ; A sapling left standing in a fallen wood.	n:ras,105,3~ras,105,3
